WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000023968 — Episode 3 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:06.540
Welcome, Sylvia. I'm your personal affinity system.

2
00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:09.040
Earn affinity from your beast mates,

3
00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:13.540
and you'll be able to unlock mysterious items, powerful abilities,

4
00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:18.040
and the chance to break your curse and get your youth back.

5
00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:22.040
Wait, you're saying if I make these guys like me,

6
00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:26.540
I can actually break this curse and get my 20-year-old body back?

7
00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:29.040
That's correct, Sylvia. The rules are simple.

8
00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:31.940
Turn your beast mates' affection into raw points,

9
00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:36.240
and trade those points for rewards, including age reversal.

10
00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:40.140
Okay, great. Love that. What do I do first?

11
00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:43.640
Selecting Beast Mates. Selection Complete.

12
00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:45.740
Your assigned mates are

13
00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:49.140
Alistair, the White Dragon,

14
00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:51.640
Jax, the Black Wolf,

15
00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:54.990
Finn, the Lop Rabbit.

16
00:00:54.990 --> 00:01:02.350
Wait, all three? You want me to...

17
00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:05.150
Hey! Are you gonna keep stalling all day?

18
00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:09.250
Oh, don't rush her, Rosie. I'd actually prefer if she didn't choose at all.

19
00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:11.550
Guards! See Sylvia!

20
00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:15.550
She refuses to claim a beast mate! By law, she should be executed!

21
00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:23.840
No, no, no! Who said I was refusing?

22
00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:27.540
Take all three of them!

23
00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:29.040
She actually wants us?

24
00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:31.740
Oh, thank God. We're not gonna be slaughtered.

25
00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:33.940
An old hack thinks she can tame me.

26
00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:36.540
If she knew I was the Black Wolf's deadliest assassin,

27
00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:38.140
she'd be dead from fear.

28
00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:40.840
A 70-year-old princess taking three mates?

29
00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:42.940
No, this smells like a setup.

30
00:01:42.940 --> 00:01:46.940
The Obsidian Empire is trying to expose my royal identity.

31
00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:50.470
I need to stay cautious.

32
00:01:50.470 --> 00:01:53.070
You said what? Are you out of your mind?

33
00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:55.170
I said what I said!

34
00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:57.470
I'm claiming all three!
